#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Do not expand the lower and upper limit if the graph contains a value outside the valid range."
msgstr "Ära laienda alumist ja ülemist piiri, kui graafik sisaldab väärtust väljaspool kehtivat vahemikku."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Upper Limit (--upper-limit)"
msgstr "Ülempiir (--upper-limit)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The maximum vertical value for the graph."
msgstr "Graafiku maksimaalne vertikaalne väärtus."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Lower Limit (--lower-limit)"
msgstr "Alampiir (--lower-limit)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The minimum vertical value for the graph."
msgstr "Graafiku minimaalne vertikaalne väärtus."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Grid Options"
msgstr "Ruudustiku valikud"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Unit Grid Value (--unit/--y-grid)"
msgstr "Ühiku ruudustiku väärtus (--unit/--y-grid)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Sets the exponent value on the Y-axis for numbers. Note: This option is deprecated and replaced by the --y-grid option.  In this option, Y-axis grid lines appear at each grid step interval.  Labels are placed every label factor lines."
msgstr "Määrab arvude eksponendi Y-teljel. Märkus: see valik on iganenud ja asendatud valikuga --y-grid.  Selle valiku korral ilmuvad Y-telje ruudustiku jooned igal ruudustiku sammul.  Sildid paigutatakse iga silditeguri joone järel."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Unit Exponent Value (--units-exponent)"
msgstr "Ühiku eksponendi väärtus (--units-exponent)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "What unit Kadupul should use on the Y-axis. Use 3 to display everything in \"k\" or -6 to display everything in \"u\" (micro)."
msgstr "Millist ühikut Kadupul peaks Y-teljel kasutama. Kasuta väärtust 3, et kuvada kõik tähisega \"k\", või -6, et kuvada kõik tähisega \"u\" (mikro)."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Unit Length (--units-length &lt;length&gt;)"
msgstr "Ühiku pikkus (--units-length &lt;length&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "How many digits should RRDtool assume the y-axis labels to be? You may have to use this option to make enough space once you start fiddling with the y-axis labeling."
msgstr "Mitu numbrit peaks RRDtool y-telje siltidele eeldama? Selle valiku kasutamine võib olla vajalik, et tekitada piisavalt ruumi, kui hakkad y-telje märgistust kohandama."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "No Gridfit (--no-gridfit)"
msgstr "Ilma ruudustikku sobitamata (--no-gridfit)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "In order to avoid anti-aliasing blurring effects RRDtool snaps points to device resolution pixels, this results in a crisper appearance. If this is not to your liking, you can use this switch to turn this behavior off.<br><strong>Note: </strong>Gridfitting is turned off for PDF, EPS, SVG output by default."
msgstr "Et vältida antialiasingu hägustavaid mõjusid, joondab RRDtool punktid seadme eraldusvõime pikslitele, mis annab teravama väljanägemise. Kui see sulle ei meeldi, saad selle käitumise selle lülitiga välja lülitada.<br><strong>Märkus: </strong>Ruudustikku sobitamine on PDF-, EPS- ja SVG-väljundi puhul vaikimisi välja lülitatud."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Alternative Y Grid (--alt-y-grid)"
msgstr "Alternatiivne Y-ruudustik (--alt-y-grid)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The algorithm ensures that you always have a grid, that there are enough but not too many grid lines, and that the grid is metric. This parameter will also ensure that you get enough decimals displayed even if your graph goes from 69.998 to 70.001.<br><strong>Note: </strong>This parameter may interfere with --alt-autoscale options."
msgstr "Algoritm tagab, et sul on alati ruudustik, et ruudustiku jooni on piisavalt, kuid mitte liiga palju, ning et ruudustik on meetriline. See parameeter tagab ka selle, et kuvatakse piisavalt kümnendkohti, isegi kui graafik ulatub vahemikust 69.998 kuni 70.001.<br><strong>Märkus: </strong>See parameeter võib segada valikuid --alt-autoscale."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Axis Options"
msgstr "Telje valikud"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis (--right-axis &lt;scale:shift&gt;)"
msgstr "Parem telg (--right-axis &lt;scale:shift&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "A second axis will be drawn to the right of the graph. It is tied to the left axis via the scale and shift parameters."
msgstr "Graafikust paremale joonistatakse teine telg. See on vasaku teljega seotud parameetrite scale ja shift kaudu."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis Label (--right-axis-label &lt;string&gt;)"
msgstr "Parema telje silt (--right-axis-label &lt;string&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The label for the right axis."
msgstr "Parema telje silt."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis Format (--right-axis-format &lt;format&gt;)"
msgstr "Parema telje vorming (--right-axis-format &lt;format&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
#, php-format
msgid "By default, the format of the axis labels gets determined automatically.  If you want to do this yourself, use this option with the same %lf arguments you know from the PRINT and GPRINT commands."
msgstr "Vaikimisi määratakse telje siltide vorming automaatselt.  Kui soovid seda ise teha, kasuta seda valikut samade %lf argumentidega, mida tead käskudest PRINT ja GPRINT."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis Formatter (--right-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"
msgstr "Parema telje vormindaja (--right-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "When you set up the right axis labeling, apply a rule to the data format.  Supported formats include \"numeric\" where data is treated as numeric, \"timestamp\" where values are interpreted as UNIX timestamps (number of seconds since January 1970) and expressed using strftime format (default is \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\").  See also --units-length and --right-axis-format.  Finally \"duration\" where values are interpreted as duration in milliseconds.  Formatting follows the rules of valstrfduration qualified PRINT/GPRINT."
msgstr "Parema telje märgistuse seadistamisel rakenda andmevormingule reegel.  Toetatud vormingud on \"numeric\", kus andmeid käsitletakse numbritena, \"timestamp\", kus väärtusi tõlgendatakse UNIX-i ajatemplitena (sekundite arv alates 1970. aasta jaanuarist) ja esitatakse strftime-vormingus (vaikimisi \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\").  Vaata ka --units-length ja --right-axis-format.  Lõpuks \"duration\", kus väärtusi tõlgendatakse kestusena millisekundites.  Vormindamine järgib valstrfduration-kvalifikaatoriga PRINT/GPRINT reegleid."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Left Axis Formatter (--left-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"
msgstr "Vasaku telje vormindaja (--left-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "When you set up the left axis labeling, apply a rule to the data format.  Supported formats include \"numeric\" where data is treated as numeric, \"timestamp\" where values are interpreted as UNIX timestamps (number of seconds since January 1970) and expressed using strftime format (default is \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\").  See also --units-length.  Finally \"duration\" where values are interpreted as duration in milliseconds.  Formatting follows the rules of valstrfduration qualified PRINT/GPRINT."
msgstr "Vasaku telje märgistuse seadistamisel rakenda andmevormingule reegel.  Toetatud vormingud on \"numeric\", kus andmeid käsitletakse numbritena, \"timestamp\", kus väärtusi tõlgendatakse UNIX-i ajatemplitena (sekundite arv alates 1970. aasta jaanuarist) ja esitatakse strftime-vormingus (vaikimisi \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\").  Vaata ka --units-length.  Lõpuks \"duration\", kus väärtusi tõlgendatakse kestusena millisekundites.  Vormindamine järgib valstrfduration-kvalifikaatoriga PRINT/GPRINT reegleid."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Legend Options"
msgstr "Legendi valikud"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Auto Padding"
msgstr "Automaatne täitmine"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Pad text so that legend and graph data always line up. Note: this could cause graphs to take longer to render because of the larger overhead. Also Auto Padding may not be accurate on all types of graphs, consistent labeling usually helps."
msgstr "Täida tekst nii, et legend ja graafiku andmed oleksid alati joondatud. Märkus: see võib põhjustada graafikute pikemat renderdamist suurema lisakoormuse tõttu. Samuti ei pruugi automaatne täitmine olla täpne kõigi graafikutüüpide puhul, järjepidev märgistus aitab tavaliselt."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Dynamic Labels (--dynamic-labels)"
msgstr "Dünaamilised sildid (--dynamic-labels)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Draw line markers as a line."
msgstr "Joonista joonemarkerid joonena."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Force Rules Legend (--force-rules-legend)"
msgstr "Sunni reeglite legendi (--force-rules-legend)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Force the generation of HRULE and VRULE legends."
msgstr "Sunni looma HRULE- ja VRULE-legendid."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Tab Width (--tabwidth &lt;pixels&gt;)"
msgstr "Tabeldusmärgi laius (--tabwidth &lt;pixels&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "By default the tab-width is 40 pixels, use this option to change it."
msgstr "Vaikimisi on tabeldusmärgi laius 40 pikslit, selle muutmiseks kasuta seda valikut."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Legend Position (--legend-position=&lt;position&gt;)"
msgstr "Legendi asukoht (--legend-position=&lt;position&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Place the legend at the given side of the graph."
msgstr "Aseta legend graafiku antud küljele."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Legend Direction (--legend-direction=&lt;direction&gt;)"
msgstr "Legendi suund (--legend-direction=&lt;direction&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Place the legend items in the given vertical order."
msgstr "Aseta legendi kirjed antud vertikaaljärjestusse."

