msgstr "Kõigi uute seadmete vaikimisi SNMP korduskatsed."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Availability/Reachability"
msgstr "Saadavus/ligipääsetavus"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default Availability/Reachability for all new Devices.  The method Kadupul will use to determine if a Device is available for polling.  <br><i>NOTE: It is recommended that, at a minimum, SNMP always be selected.</i>"
msgstr "Kõigi uute seadmete vaikimisi saadavus/ligipääsetavus.  Meetod, mille abil Kadupul otsustab, kas seade on pollimiseks saadaval.  <br><i>MÄRKUS: soovitatav on, et vähemalt SNMP oleks alati valitud.</i>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Ping Type"
msgstr "Pingi tüüp"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default Ping type for all new Devices.</i>"
msgstr "Kõigi uute seadmete vaikimisi pingi tüüp.</i>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default Ping Port for all new Devices.  With TCP, Kadupul will attempt to Syn the port.  With UDP, Kadupul requires either a successful connection, or a 'port not reachable' error to determine if the Device is up or not."
msgstr "Kõigi uute seadmete vaikimisi pingi port.  TCP puhul proovib Kadupul porti Syn-ida.  UDP puhul nõuab Kadupul seadme töötamise kindlakstegemiseks kas õnnestunud ühendust või veateadet „port not reachable“."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default Ping Timeout value in milli-seconds for all new Devices.  The timeout values to use for Device SNMP, ICMP, UDP and TCP pinging.  ICMP Pings will be rounded up to the nearest second.  TCP and UDP connection timeouts on Windows are controlled by the operating system, and are therefore not recommended on Windows."
msgstr "Kõigi uute seadmete vaikimisi pingi ajalõpu väärtus millisekundites.  Ajalõpu väärtused, mida kasutada seadme SNMP-, ICMP-, UDP- ja TCP-pingimisel.  ICMP-pingid ümardatakse lähima sekundini üles.  TCP ja UDP ühenduse ajalõppe juhib Windowsis operatsioonisüsteem ja seetõttu ei soovitata neid Windowsis kasutada."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of times Kadupul will attempt to ping a Device before marking it as down."
msgstr "Mitu korda Kadupul seadet pingib, enne kui selle mittetöötavaks märgib."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Up/Down Settings"
msgstr "Töötab/ei tööta seaded"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Failure Count"
msgstr "Ebaõnnestumiste arv"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of polling intervals a Device must be down before logging an error and reporting Device as down."
msgstr "Pollimisintervallide arv, mille jooksul seade peab mittetöötav olema, enne kui logitakse viga ja seade märgitakse mittetöötavaks."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Recovery Count"
msgstr "Taastumiste arv"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of polling intervals a Device must remain up before returning Device to an up status and issuing a notice."
msgstr "Pollimisintervallide arv, mille jooksul seade peab töötav olema, enne kui seade tagastatakse töötavasse olekusse ja väljastatakse teade."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Theme Settings"
msgstr "Teema seaded"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "Theme"
msgstr "Teema"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Please select one of the available Themes to skin your Kadupul with."
msgstr "Vali üks saadaolevatest teemadest, et oma Kadupulile kujundus anda."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Table Settings"
msgstr "Tabeli seaded"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Rows Per Page"
msgstr "Ridu lehel"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default number of rows to display for a table."
msgstr "Tabelis kuvatavate ridade vaikimisi arv."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Autocomplete Enabled"
msgstr "Automaatne täitmine lubatud"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "In very large systems, select lists can slow the user interface significantly.  If this option is enabled, Kadupul will use autocomplete callbacks to populate the select list systematically.  Note: autocomplete is forcibly disabled on the Classic theme."
msgstr "Väga suurtes süsteemides võivad valikuloendid kasutajaliidest märkimisväärselt aeglustada.  Kui see valik on lubatud, kasutab Kadupul valikuloendi süstemaatiliseks täitmiseks automaatse täitmise tagasikutseid.  Märkus: automaatne täitmine on Classic-teemal sunnitult keelatud."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Autocomplete Rows"
msgstr "Automaatse täitmise read"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid ".  This is limited by the php setting 'max_input_vars', currently:"
msgstr ".  Seda piirab php seadistus 'max_input_vars', praegu:"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default number of rows to return from an autocomplete based select pattern match."
msgstr "Automaatsel täitmisel põhineva valiku mustrisobituse puhul tagastatavate ridade vaikimisi arv."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Minimum Tree Width"
msgstr "Puu minimaalne laius"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Minimum width of the Tree to contract to."
msgstr "Minimaalne laius, milleni puu kokku tõmmatakse."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Tree Width"
msgstr "Puu maksimaalne laius"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Maximum width of the Tree to expand to, after which time, Tree branches will scroll on the page."
msgstr "Maksimaalne laius, milleni puu laieneb, mille järel puuharud lehel kerivad."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Filter Settings"
msgstr "Filtri seaded"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Strip Domains from Device Dropdowns"
msgstr "Eemalda seadmete rippmenüüdest domeenid"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When viewing Device name filter dropdowns, checking this option will strip the domain from the hostname."
msgstr "Seadme nime filtri rippmenüüde vaatamisel eemaldab selle valiku märkimine hostinimest domeeni."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph/Data Source/Data Query Settings"
msgstr "Graafiku/andmeallika/andmepäringu seaded"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Title Length"
msgstr "Maksimaalne pealkirja pikkus"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum allowable Graph or Data Source titles."
msgstr "Graafiku või andmeallika pealkirjade maksimaalne lubatud pikkus."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Source Field Length"
msgstr "Andmeallika välja pikkus"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum Data Query field length."
msgstr "Andmepäringu välja maksimaalne pikkus."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph Creation"
msgstr "Graafiku loomine"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default Graph Type"
msgstr "Vaikimisi graafiku tüüp"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When creating graphs, what Graph Type would you like preselected?"
msgstr "Millise graafiku tüübi soovid graafikute loomisel eelvalituks?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "All Types"
msgstr "Kõik tüübid"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "By Template/Data Query"
msgstr "Malli/andmepäringu järgi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Log Management"
msgstr "Logide haldus"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default Log Tail Lines"
msgstr "Vaikimisi logi lõpuridade arv"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default number of lines of the Kadupul log file to tail."
msgstr "Kadupuli logifailist kuvatavate lõpuridade vaikimisi arv."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum number of rows per page"
msgstr "Maksimaalne ridade arv lehel"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "User defined number of lines for the CLOG to tail when selecting 'All lines'."
msgstr "Kasutaja määratud ridade arv, mida CLOG kuvab valiku „Kõik read“ korral."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Log Tail Refresh"
msgstr "Logi lõpu värskendamine"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How often do you want the Kadupul log display to update?"
msgstr "Kui sageli soovid Kadupuli logikuva värskendada?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Log Viewer Settings"
msgstr "Logivaaturi seaded"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Exclusion Regex"
msgstr "Välistamise regulaaravaldis"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Any strings that match this regex will be excluded from the user display.  <strong>For example, if you want to exclude all log lines that include the words 'Admin' or 'Login' you would type '(Admin || Login)'</strong>"
msgstr "Kõik sõned, mis selle regulaaravaldisega sobivad, jäetakse kasutajale kuvatavast välja.  <strong>Näiteks kui soovid välistada kõik logiread, mis sisaldavad sõnu 'Admin' või 'Login', sisesta '(Admin || Login)'</strong>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Real-time Graphs"
msgstr "Reaalajas graafikud"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Real-time Graphing"
msgstr "Luba reaalajas graafikute kuvamine"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When an option is checked, users will be able to put Kadupul into Real-time mode."
msgstr "Kui valik on märgitud, saavad kasutajad lülitada Kadupuli reaalajarežiimi."

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html_reports.php
msgid "Graph Timespan"
msgstr "Graafiku ajavahemik"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The timespan you wish to see on the default graph."
msgstr "Ajavahemik, mida soovid vaikimisi graafikul näha."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Minimum Refresh Interval"
msgstr "Minimaalne värskendusintervall"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the minimal supported time between Graph updates.  This value is also used to set certain RRDfile attributes.  If you have a Device that caches data and does not provide realtime updates, you may have to increase the default Minimum Refresh Interval to prevent creating Graphs with gaps."
msgstr "See on minimaalne toetatud aeg graafikute uuenduste vahel.  Seda väärtust kasutatakse ka teatud RRDfile'i atribuutide määramiseks.  Kui sul on seade, mis puhverdab andmeid ega paku reaalajas uuendusi, võib olla vaja suurendada vaikimisi minimaalset värskendusintervalli, et vältida lünkadega graafikute loomist."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Cache Directory"
msgstr "Vahemälu kataloog"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the location, on the web server where the RRDfiles and PNG files will be cached.  This cache will be managed by the poller.  Make sure you have the correct read and write permissions on this folder"
msgstr "See on veebiserveri asukoht, kuhu RRDfile'id ja PNG-failid vahemällu salvestatakse.  Seda vahemälu haldab pollija.  Veendu, et sellel kaustal on õiged lugemis- ja kirjutusõigused"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "RRDtool Graph Options"
msgstr "RRDtool-i graafiku valikud"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Custom Watermark"
msgstr "Kohandatud vesimärk"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Text placed at the bottom center of every Graph."
msgstr "Tekst, mis paigutatakse iga graafiku allserva keskele."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Custom Date Format"
msgstr "Kohandatud kuupäevavorming"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "To be used when formatting |date_time| on a graph"
msgstr "Kasutatakse graafikul |date_time| vormindamisel"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Disable RRDtool Watermark"
msgstr "Keela RRDtool-i vesimärk"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Provided your RRDtool version supports it, you may disable RRDtool advertisement on your Graphs by checking this option."
msgstr "Kui sinu RRDtool-i versioon seda toetab, võid selle valiku märkimisega oma graafikutel RRDtool-i reklaami keelata."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Font Selection Method"
msgstr "Fondi valiku meetod"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How do you wish fonts to be handled by default?"
msgstr "Kuidas soovid, et fonte vaikimisi käsitletaks?"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/api_device.php
msgid "System"
msgstr "Süsteem"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default Font"
msgstr "Vaikefont"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When not using Theme based font control, the Pango font description to use for all Graphs, such as DejaVu Sans. Optionally, you may leave blank and control font settings on a per object basis."
msgstr "Kui teemapõhist fondijuhtimist ei kasutata, kõigil graafikutel kasutatav Pango fondi kirjeldus, näiteks DejaVu Sans. Soovi korral võid jätta tühjaks ja juhtida fondi seadeid objektipõhiselt."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Business Hours Settings"
msgstr "Tööaja seaded"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Start of Business Day"
msgstr "Tööpäeva algus"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The time your business hours start. Format: hh:mm"
msgstr "Aeg, mil sinu tööaeg algab. Vorming: hh:mm"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "End of Business Day"
msgstr "Tööpäeva lõpp"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The time your business hours end. Format: hh:mm"
msgstr "Aeg, mil sinu tööaeg lõpeb. Vorming: hh:mm"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Hide Weekends"
msgstr "Peida nädalavahetused"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Only show business hours during weekdays."
msgstr "Kuva tööaega ainult tööpäevadel."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Show business hours"
msgstr "Kuva tööaeg"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Display business hours on rrd graphs."
msgstr "Kuva tööaega rrd-graafikutel."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Color to use for business hours"
msgstr "Tööaja jaoks kasutatav värv"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The color to be shown for business hours"
msgstr "Tööaja jaoks kuvatav värv"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum number of days to show business hours"
msgstr "Maksimaalne päevade arv tööaja kuvamiseks"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "After this number of days, the business hours will not be added to the graph. <br/>Recommended: 62 days"
msgstr "Pärast seda päevade arvu ei lisata tööaega graafikule. <br/>Soovitatav: 62 päeva"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Collection Enabled"
msgstr "Andmekogumine lubatud"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you wish to stop the polling process completely, uncheck this box."
msgstr "Kui soovid pollimisprotsessi täielikult peatada, eemalda see märge."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Agent Support Enabled"
msgstr "SNMP agendi tugi lubatud"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If this option is checked, Kadupul will populate SNMP Agent tables with Kadupul device and system information.  It does not enable the SNMP Agent itself."
msgstr "Kui see valik on märgitud, täidab Kadupul SNMP agendi tabelid Kadupuli seadme ja süsteemi teabega.  See ei luba SNMP agenti ennast."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Type"
msgstr "Pollija tüüp"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The poller type to use.  This setting will take effect at next polling interval."
msgstr "Kasutatav pollija tüüp.  See seadistus jõustub järgmisel pollimisintervallil."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Sync Interval"
msgstr "Pollija sünkroonimisintervall"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default polling sync interval to use when creating a poller.  This setting will affect how often remote pollers are checked and updated."
msgstr "Pollija loomisel kasutatav vaikimisi pollimise sünkroonimisintervall.  See seadistus mõjutab, kui sageli kaugpollijaid kontrollitakse ja uuendatakse."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The polling interval in use.  This setting will affect how often RRDfiles are checked and updated.  <strong><u>NOTE: If you change this value, you must re-populate the poller cache.  Failure to do so, may result in lost data.</u></strong>"
msgstr "Kasutatav pollimisintervall.  See seadistus mõjutab, kui sageli RRDfile'e kontrollitakse ja uuendatakse.  <strong><u>MÄRKUS: kui sa seda väärtust muudad, pead pollija vahemälu uuesti täitma.  Selle tegemata jätmine võib põhjustada andmete kadumist.</u></strong>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Cron/Daemon Interval"
msgstr "Cron/deemoni intervall"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The frequency that the Kadupul data collector will be started.  You can use either crontab, a scheduled task (for windows), or the cactid systemd service to control launching the Kadupul data collector.  For instructions on using the cactid daemon, review the README.md file in the service directory."
msgstr "Sagedus, millega Kadupuli andmekoguja käivitatakse.  Kadupuli andmekoguja käivitamise juhtimiseks võid kasutada kas crontabi, ajastatud ülesannet (Windowsis) või cactid systemd teenust.  Cactid deemoni kasutamise juhised leiad teenusekataloogi failist README.md."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Balance Process Load"
msgstr "Tasakaalusta protsesside koormust"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you choose this option, Kadupul will attempt to balance the load of each poller process by equally distributing poller items per process."
msgstr "Selle valiku korral püüab Kadupul tasakaalustada iga pollija protsessi koormust, jaotades pollija kirjed protsesside vahel võrdselt."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Debug Output Width"
msgstr "Silumisväljundi laius"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you choose this option, Kadupul will check for output that exceeds Kadupul's ability to store it and issue a warning when it finds it."
msgstr "Selle valiku korral kontrollib Kadupul väljundit, mis ületab Kadupuli salvestusvõimet, ja annab selle leidmisel hoiatuse."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Disable increasing OID Check"
msgstr "Keela kasvava OID kontroll"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Controls disabling check for increasing OID while walking OID tree."
msgstr "Juhib OID-puu läbimisel kasvava OID kontrolli keelamist."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Remote Agent Timeout"
msgstr "Kaugagendi ajalõpp"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The amount of time, in seconds, that the Central Kadupul web server will wait for a response from the Remote Data Collector to obtain various Device information before abandoning the request.  On Devices that are associated with Data Collectors other than the Central Kadupul Data Collector, the Remote Agent must be used to gather Device information."
msgstr "Aeg sekundites, mille Kadupuli keskne veebiserver ootab kaugandmekogujalt vastust erinevate seadme andmete saamiseks, enne kui päring loobutakse.  Seadmetel, mis on seotud muude kui Kadupuli keskse andmekogujaga, tuleb seadme teabe kogumiseks kasutada kaugagenti."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Bulkwalk Fetch Size"
msgstr "SNMP Bulkwalk'i toomise suurus"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How many OIDs should be returned per snmpbulkwalk request?  For Devices with large SNMP trees, increasing this size will increase re-index performance over a WAN."
msgstr "Mitu OID-i tuleks snmpbulkwalk-päringu kohta tagastada?  Suurte SNMP-puudega seadmete puhul parandab selle suuruse suurendamine uuesti indekseerimise jõudlust üle WAN-i."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Get OID Limit"
msgstr "SNMP Get OID piirang"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default maximum number of SNMP Get OIDs to issue per snmpget request.  For Devices, this setting is controlled at the Device level.  You should only use this setting when using Kadupul's SNMP API natively in your scripts or plugins."
msgstr "Ühe snmpget-päringu kohta väljastatavate SNMP Get OID-ide vaikimisi maksimaalne arv.  Seadmete puhul juhitakse seda seadistust seadme tasemel.  Kasuta seda seadistust ainult siis, kui kasutad Kadupuli SNMP API-t otse oma skriptides või pistikprogrammides."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Rejected Sample Retention"
msgstr "Tagasilükatud proovide säilitamine"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Hours that samples refused by RRDtool, for example after a data source schema change, stay queued for retry before they are moved to the poller_output_rejected table.  Repair the RRDfile, then run cli/replay_rejected_samples.php to process them."
msgstr "Tunnid, mille jooksul RRDtool-i poolt tagasi lükatud proovid, näiteks pärast andmeallika skeemi muutust, jäävad korduskatseks järjekorda, enne kui need teisaldatakse tabelisse poller_output_rejected.  Paranda RRDfile, seejärel käivita nende töötlemiseks cli/replay_rejected_samples.php."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Rejected Sample Limit"
msgstr "Tagasilükatud proovide piirang"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The most refused samples one data source may keep queued.  The oldest samples beyond this limit are moved to the poller_output_rejected table immediately."
msgstr "Suurim arv tagasi lükatud proove, mida üks andmeallikas võib järjekorras hoida.  Selle piiri ületavad vanimad proovid teisaldatakse kohe tabelisse poller_output_rejected."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Disable Resource Cache Replication"
msgstr "Keela ressursivahemälu replikatsioon"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "By default, the main Kadupul Data Collector will cache the entire web site and plugins into a Resource Cache.  Then, periodically the Remote Data Collectors will update themselves with any updates from the main Kadupul Data Collector.  This Resource Cache essentially allows Remote Data Collectors to self upgrade.  If you do not wish to use this option, you can disable it using this setting."
msgstr "Vaikimisi salvestab Kadupuli peamine andmekoguja kogu veebisaidi ja pistikprogrammid ressursivahemällu.  Seejärel uuendavad kaugandmekogujad end perioodiliselt Kadupuli peamise andmekogujaga võrreldes tehtud uuendustega.  See ressursivahemälu võimaldab kaugandmekogujatel sisuliselt ennast ise uuendada.  Kui sa ei soovi seda valikut kasutada, võid selle selle seadistusega keelata."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Additional Data Collector Settings"
msgstr "Täiendavad andmekoguja seaded"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Invalid Data Logging"
msgstr "Kehtetute andmete logimine"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How would you like the Data Collector output errors logged?  Options include: 'Detailed' which details every error, 'Summary' which provides the number of output errors per Device, and 'None', which does not provide error counts."
msgstr "Kuidas soovid andmekoguja väljundvigu logida?  Valikud: „Üksikasjalik“, mis annab iga vea üksikasjad, „Kokkuvõte“, mis annab väljundvigade arvu seadme kohta, ja „Puudub“, mis ei anna vigade arvu."

#: include/global_settings.php utilities.php
msgid "Summary"
msgstr "Kokkuvõte"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Detailed"
msgstr "Üksikasjalik"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of PHP Script Servers"
msgstr "PHP skriptiserverite arv"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent script server processes to run per spine process.  Settings between 1 and 15 are accepted.  This parameter will help if you are running several threads and script server scripts and is only valid for the spine Data Collector."
msgstr "Ühe spine-protsessi kohta käivitatavate samaaegsete skriptiserveri protsesside arv.  Aktsepteeritakse seadeid vahemikus 1 kuni 15.  See parameeter aitab, kui käivitad mitu lõime ja skriptiserveri skripti, ning kehtib ainult spine'i andmekoguja puhul."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Script and Script Server Timeout Value"
msgstr "Skripti ja skriptiserveri ajalõpu väärtus"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum time that spine will wait on a script to complete.  This timeout value is in seconds and is only valid for the spine Data Collector."
msgstr "Maksimaalne aeg, mille spine skripti lõppemist ootab.  See ajalõpu väärtus on sekundites ja kehtib ainult spine'i andmekoguja puhul."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Periodic All Device Re-Index"
msgstr "Perioodiline kõigi seadmete uuesti indekseerimine"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Re-Index All Device Schedule"
msgstr "Kõigi seadmete uuesti indekseerimise ajakava"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "At what frequency do you wish to Re-Index all Devices.  This Re-Index will occur at midnight at the frequency that you select."
msgstr "Kui sageli soovid kõiki seadmeid uuesti indekseerida.  See uuesti indekseerimine toimub keskööl valitud sagedusega."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Weekly on Sunday"
msgstr "Iganädalaselt pühapäeviti"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Monthly on Sunday"
msgstr "Igakuiselt pühapäeviti"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Background Timeout and Concurrent Process Settings"
msgstr "Taustaprotsesside ajalõpu ja samaaegsete protsesside seaded"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Report Generation Timeout"
msgstr "Aruande loomise ajalõpp"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Kadupul's Reports Generation script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Maksimaalne aeg, mille Kadupuli aruannete loomise skript võib töötada, tekitamata ajalõpuviga ja ilma, et see lõpetataks."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s Minute"
msgstr "%s minut"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Source Statistics Timeout"
msgstr "Andmeallika statistika ajalõpp"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Kadupul's Data Source Statistics script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Maksimaalne aeg, mille Kadupuli andmeallika statistika skript võib töötada, tekitamata ajalõpuviga ja ilma, et see lõpetataks."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "RRDChecker Timeout"
msgstr "RRDCheckeri ajalõpp"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Kadupul's RRDfile check script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Maksimaalne aeg, mille Kadupuli RRDfile'i kontrolli skript võib töötada, tekitamata ajalõpuviga ja ilma, et see lõpetataks."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s Hour"
msgstr "%s tund"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Commands Timeout"
msgstr "Pollija käskude ajalõpp"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Kadupul's Background Commands script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed.  This script will perform tasks such as re-indexing Devices and pruning devices from Remote Data Collectors."
msgstr "Maksimaalne aeg, mille Kadupuli taustakäskude skript võib töötada, tekitamata ajalõpuviga ja ilma, et see lõpetataks.  See skript täidab ülesandeid, näiteks seadmete uuesti indekseerimine ja seadmete eemaldamine kaugandmekogujatelt."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Command Concurrent Processes"
msgstr "Pollija käskude samaaegsed protsessid"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent Poller Command processes.  There will be at most one concurrent command per host within the Poller Command pool."
msgstr "Samaaegsete pollija käsuprotsesside arv.  Pollija käskude kogumis on hosti kohta korraga kuni üks käsk."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "1 Process"
msgstr "1 protsess"

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Processes"
msgstr "%d protsessi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maintenance Background Generation Timeout"
msgstr "Hoolduse taustaloomise ajalõpp"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Kadupul's Maintenance script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Maksimaalne aeg, mille Kadupuli hooldusskript võib töötada, tekitamata ajalõpuviga ja ilma, et see lõpetataks."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Spikekill Background Generation Timeout"
msgstr "Spikekilli taustaloomise ajalõpp"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Kadupul's Spikekill script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Maksimaalne aeg, mille Kadupuli Spikekilli skript võib töötada, tekitamata ajalõpuviga ja ilma, et see lõpetataks."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Collector Defaults"
msgstr "Andmekoguja vaikeväärtused"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "These settings are maintained at the Data Collector level.  The values here are only defaults used when first creating a Data Collector."
msgstr "Neid seadeid hallatakse andmekoguja tasemel.  Siinsed väärtused on ainult vaikeväärtused, mida kasutatakse andmekoguja esmasel loomisel."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Collector Processes"
msgstr "Andmekoguja protsessid"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default number of concurrent processes to execute per Data Collector.  NOTE: Starting from Kadupul 1.2, this setting is maintained in the Data Collector.  Moving forward, this value is only a preset for the Data Collector.  Using a higher number when using cmd.php will improve performance.  Performance improvements in Spine are best resolved with the threads parameter.  When using Spine, we recommend a lower number and leveraging threads instead.  When using cmd.php, use no more than 2x the number of CPU cores."
msgstr "Iga andmekoguja kohta käivitatavate samaaegsete protsesside vaikimisi arv.  MÄRKUS: alates Kadupul 1.2 hallatakse seda seadistust andmekogujas.  Edaspidi on see väärtus ainult andmekoguja eelseadistus.  Suurema arvu kasutamine cmd.php puhul parandab jõudlust.  Spine'i jõudluse parandusi saab kõige paremini lahendada parameetriga threads.  Spine'i kasutamisel soovitame väiksemat arvu ja selle asemel lõimede kasutamist.  cmd.php kasutamisel ära kasuta rohkem kui 2x protsessori tuumade arvu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Threads per Process"
msgstr "Lõimed protsessi kohta"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Default Threads allowed per process.  NOTE: Starting in Kadupul 1.2+, this setting is maintained in the Data Collector, and this is simply the Preset.  Using a higher number when using Spine will improve performance.  However, ensure that you have enough MySQL/MariaDB connections to support the following equation: connections = data collectors * processes * (threads + script servers).  You must also ensure that you have enough spare connections for user login connections as well."
msgstr "Protsessi kohta lubatud lõimede vaikearv.  MÄRKUS: alates Kadupul 1.2+ hallatakse seda seadistust andmekogujas ja see on lihtsalt eelseadistus.  Suurema arvu kasutamine Spine'i puhul parandab jõudlust.  Veendu aga, et sul on piisavalt MySQL/MariaDB ühendusi järgmise võrrandi toetamiseks: ühendused = andmekogujad * protsessid * (lõimed + skriptiserverid).  Pead tagama ka piisavalt reserveeritud ühendusi kasutajate sisselogimisühenduste jaoks."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Authentication Method"
msgstr "Autentimismeetod"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "<blockquote><i>Built-in Authentication</i> - Kadupul handles user authentication, which allows you to create users and give them rights to different areas within Kadupul.<br><br><i>Web Basic Authentication</i> - Authentication is handled by the web server. Users can be added or created automatically on first login if the Template User is defined, otherwise the defined guest permissions will be used.<br><br><i>LDAP Authentication</i> - Allows for authentication against an LDAP server. Users will be created automatically on first login if the Template User is defined, otherwise the defined guest permissions will be used.  If PHP's LDAP module is not enabled, LDAP Authentication will not appear as a selectable option.<br><br><i>Multiple LDAP/AD Domain Authentication</i> - Allows administrators to support multiple disparate groups from different LDAP/AD directories to access Kadupul resources.  Just as LDAP Authentication, the PHP LDAP module is required to utilize this method.</blockquote>"
msgstr "<blockquote><i>Sisseehitatud autentimine</i> - Kadupul haldab kasutajate autentimist, mis võimaldab sul luua kasutajaid ja anda neile õigused Kadupuli eri osadele.<br><br><i>Veebipõhine Basic-autentimine</i> - Autentimist haldab veebiserver. Kasutajaid saab lisada või automaatselt luua esimesel sisselogimisel, kui mallkasutaja on määratud, vastasel juhul kasutatakse määratud külalisõigusi.<br><br><i>LDAP-autentimine</i> - Võimaldab autentimist LDAP-serveri vastu. Kasutajad luuakse automaatselt esimesel sisselogimisel, kui mallkasutaja on määratud, vastasel juhul kasutatakse määratud külalisõigusi.  Kui PHP LDAP-moodul ei ole lubatud, ei kuvata LDAP-autentimist valitava valikuna.<br><br><i>Mitme LDAP/AD domeeni autentimine</i> - Võimaldab administraatoritel toetada mitut erinevat rühma eri LDAP/AD kataloogidest Kadupuli ressurssidele juurdepääsuks.  Nagu LDAP-autentimine, nõuab ka see meetod PHP LDAP-moodulit.</blockquote>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Support Authentication Cookies"
msgstr "Toeta autentimisküpsiseid"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If a user authenticates and selects 'Keep me signed in', an authentication cookie will be created on the user's computer allowing that user to stay logged in.  The authentication cookie expires after 90 days of non-use."
msgstr "Kui kasutaja autendib ja valib „Hoia mind sisselogituna“, luuakse kasutaja arvutisse autentimisküpsis, mis võimaldab kasutajal sisse logituks jääda.  Autentimisküpsis aegub 90 päeva möödudes kasutamata jätmisest."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Special Users"
msgstr "Erikasutajad"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Primary Admin"
msgstr "Peaadministraator"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The name of the primary administrative account that will automatically receive Emails when the Kadupul system experiences issues.  To receive these Emails, ensure that your mail settings are correct, and the administrative account has an Email address that is set."
msgstr "Peamise administraatorikonto nimi, mis saab automaatselt e-kirju, kui Kadupuli süsteemis tekivad probleemid.  Nende e-kirjade saamiseks veendu, et sinu postiseaded on õiged ja administraatorikontol on määratud e-posti aadress."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "No User"
msgstr "Kasutaja puudub"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Guest User"
msgstr "Külalisekasutaja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The name of the guest user for viewing graphs; is 'No User' by default."
msgstr "Graafikute vaatamiseks mõeldud külalisekasutaja nimi; vaikimisi 'Kasutaja puudub'."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "User Template"
msgstr "Kasutajamall"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The name of the user that Kadupul will use as a template for new Web Basic and LDAP users; is 'guest' by default.  This user account will be disabled from logging in upon being selected."
msgstr "Kasutaja nimi, keda Kadupul kasutab mallina uute veebipõhise Basic- ja LDAP-kasutajate jaoks; vaikimisi 'guest'.  Selle kasutajakonto sisselogimine keelatakse selle valimisel."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Basic Authentication Settings"
msgstr "Basic-autentimise seaded"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Basic Auth Login Failure Message"
msgstr "Basic-autentimise sisselogimisvea teade"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When using basic authentication, if there are issues mapping the username to a valid Kadupul account, the message included here will be displayed to users.  It can include both text and HTML."
msgstr "Basic-autentimise kasutamisel kuvatakse kasutajatele siin esitatud teade, kui kasutajanime kaardistamisel kehtivale Kadupuli kontole tekib probleeme.  See võib sisaldada nii teksti kui ka HTML-i."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Basic Auth Mapfile"
msgstr "Basic-autentimise vastendusfail"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When using basic authentication, if the basic account needs to be translated to a different login account, you can specify a CSV file here to map the basic account to the desired login account."
msgstr "Basic-autentimise kasutamisel, kui Basic-konto tuleb tõlkida teisele sisselogimiskontole, saad siin määrata CSV-faili, mis vastendab Basic-konto soovitud sisselogimiskontoga."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Local Account Complexity Requirements"
msgstr "Kohaliku konto keerukusnõuded"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Minimum Length"
msgstr "Minimaalne pikkus"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the minimal length of allowed passwords."
msgstr "See on lubatud paroolide minimaalne pikkus."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Require Mix Case"
msgstr "Nõua segatud tähesuurust"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This will require new passwords to contain both lower and upper-case characters."
msgstr "See nõuab, et uued paroolid sisaldaksid nii väiketähti kui ka suurtähti."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Require Number"
msgstr "Nõua numbrit"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This will require new passwords to contain at least 1 numerical character."
msgstr "See nõuab, et uued paroolid sisaldaksid vähemalt 1 numbrimärki."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Require Special Character"
msgstr "Nõua erimärki"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This will require new passwords to contain at least 1 special character."
msgstr "See nõuab, et uued paroolid sisaldaksid vähemalt 1 erimärki."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Force Complexity Upon Old Passwords"
msgstr "Sunni keerukus vanadele paroolidele"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This will require all old passwords to also meet the new complexity requirements upon login.  If not met, it will force a password change."
msgstr "See nõuab, et ka kõik vanad paroolid vastaksid sisselogimisel uutele keerukusnõuetele.  Kui need ei vasta, sunnitakse parooli muutma."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Expire Inactive Accounts"
msgstr "Aegu mitteaktiivsed kontod"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the maximum number of days before inactive accounts are disabled.  The Admin account is excluded from this policy."
msgstr "See on maksimaalne päevade arv, enne kui mitteaktiivsed kontod keelatakse.  Administraatorikonto on sellest poliitikast välja jäetud."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Expire Password"
msgstr "Parooli aegumine"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the maximum number of days before a password is set to expire."
msgstr "See on maksimaalne päevade arv, enne kui parool aegub."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Password History"
msgstr "Paroolide ajalugu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Remember this number of old passwords and disallow reusing them."
msgstr "Jäta meelde see arv vanu paroole ja keela nende taaskasutamine."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "1 Change"
msgstr "1 muudatus"

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Changes"
msgstr "%d muudatust"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Account Locking"
msgstr "Konto lukustamine"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Lock Accounts"
msgstr "Lukusta kontod"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Lock an account after this many failed attempts in 1 hour."
msgstr "Lukusta konto pärast nii paljusid ebaõnnestunud katseid 1 tunni jooksul."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "1 Attempt"
msgstr "1 katse"

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Attempts"
msgstr "%d katset"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Auto Unlock"
msgstr "Automaatne avamine"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "An account will automatically be unlocked after this many minutes.  Even if the correct password is entered, the account will not unlock until this time limit has been met.  Max of 1440 minutes (1 Day)"
msgstr "Konto avatakse automaatselt pärast nii paljusid minuteid.  Isegi kui sisestatakse õige parool, ei avata kontot enne, kui see ajapiir on täis.  Maksimaalselt 1440 minutit (1 päev)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "1 Day"
msgstr "1 päev"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "LDAP General Settings"
msgstr "LDAP üldseaded"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Server(s)"
msgstr "Server(id)"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "A space delimited list of DNS hostnames or IP addresses for valid LDAP servers.  Kadupul will attempt to use the LDAP servers from left to right to authenticate a user."
msgstr "Tühikuga eraldatud loend kehtivate LDAP-serverite DNS-hostinimedest või IP-aadressidest.  Kadupul proovib kasutaja autentimiseks kasutada LDAP-servereid vasakult paremale."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Port Standard"
msgstr "Standardport"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TCP port for Non-SSL communications including LDAP + TLS.  Default is 389."
msgstr "TCP port mitte-SSL-suhtluseks, sh LDAP + TLS.  Vaikimisi 389."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Port SSL"
msgstr "SSL-port"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TCP port for LDAPS for SSL communications.  Default is 636."
msgstr "TCP port LDAPS-i jaoks SSL-suhtlusel.  Vaikimisi 636."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Protocol Version"
msgstr "Protokolli versioon"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Protocol Version to connect to the server with."
msgstr "Protokolli versioon, millega serveriga ühenduda."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Connect Timeout"
msgstr "Ühendumise ajalõpp"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Network Connect Timeout in seconds."
msgstr "Võrguühenduse ajalõpp sekundites."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Bind Timeout"
msgstr "Sidumise ajalõpp"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Bind Timeout in seconds."
msgstr "Sidumise (bind) ajalõpp sekundites."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "LDAP Debug Mode"
msgstr "LDAP silumisrežiim"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If Checked Kadupul will log extra LDAP information to the Kadupul log during Binding and Searching activities."
msgstr "Kui see on märgitud, logib Kadupul sidumise ja otsingu tegevuste ajal Kadupuli logisse lisateavet LDAP kohta."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Encryption"
msgstr "Krüptimine"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Encryption that the server supports. NOTE: When using LDAP + TLS you must use version 3."
msgstr "Krüptimine, mida server toetab. MÄRKUS: LDAP + TLS kasutamisel pead kasutama versiooni 3."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TLS Certificate Requirements"
msgstr "TLS-sertifikaadi nõuded"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Should LDAP verify TLS Certificates when received by the Client.  Demand and Hard refuse a server whose certificate does not verify.  Never and Allow skip that check, so anyone on the network path can pose as the directory and read the passwords sent to it."
msgstr "Kas LDAP peaks kliendi poolt saadud TLS-sertifikaate kontrollima.  Demand ja Hard keelduvad serverist, mille sertifikaati ei saa kontrollida.  Never ja Allow jätavad selle kontrolli vahele, mistõttu võib igaüks võrguteel esineda kataloogina ja lugeda talle saadetud paroole."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Referrals"
msgstr "Viited"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Enable or Disable LDAP referrals.  If disabled, it may increase the speed of searches."
msgstr "Luba või keela LDAP-viited (referrals).  Kui see on keelatud, võib see otsinguid kiirendada."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "Režiim"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Mode which cacti will attempt to authenticate against the LDAP server.<blockquote><i>No Searching</i> - No Distinguished Name (DN) searching occurs, just attempt to bind with the provided Distinguished Name (DN) format.<br><br><i>Anonymous Searching</i> - Attempts to search for username against LDAP directory via anonymous binding to locate the user's Distinguished Name (DN).<br><br><i>Specific Searching</i> - Attempts to search for username against LDAP directory via Specific Distinguished Name (DN) and Specific Password for binding to locate the user's Distinguished Name (DN)."
msgstr "Režiim, milles Kadupul proovib LDAP-serveri vastu autentida.<blockquote><i>Otsimist pole</i> - Eristusnime (DN) otsingut ei tehta, proovitakse lihtsalt siduda esitatud eristusnime (DN) vormingus.<br><br><i>Anonüümne otsing</i> - Proovib otsida kasutajanime LDAP-kataloogist anonüümse sidumise kaudu, et leida kasutaja eristusnimi (DN).<br><br><i>Kindel otsing</i> - Proovib otsida kasutajanime LDAP-kataloogist kindla eristusnime (DN) ja kindla sidumisparooli kaudu, et leida kasutaja eristusnimi (DN)."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Distinguished Name (DN)"
msgstr "Eristusnimi (DN)"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "The \"Distinguished Name\" syntax, applicable for both OpenLDAP and Windows AD configurations, offers flexibility in defining user identity. For OpenLDAP, the format follows this structure: <i>\"uid=&lt;username&gt;,ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local\"</i>. Windows AD provides an alternative syntax: <i>\"&lt;username&gt;@win2kdomain.local\"</i>, commonly known as \"userPrincipalName (UPN)\". In this context, \"&lt;username&gt;\" represents the specific username provided during the login prompt. This is particularly pertinent when operating in \"No Searching\" mode, or \"Require Group Membership\" enabled."
msgstr "Süntaks „Eristusnimi“, mis sobib nii OpenLDAP-i kui ka Windows AD konfiguratsioonide jaoks, pakub paindlikkust kasutaja identiteedi määratlemisel. OpenLDAP-i puhul on vorming järgmine: <i>\"uid=&lt;username&gt;,ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local\"</i>. Windows AD pakub alternatiivset süntaksit: <i>\"&lt;username&gt;@win2kdomain.local\"</i>, mida tuntakse üldiselt kui „userPrincipalName (UPN)“. Selles kontekstis tähistab \"&lt;username&gt;\" sisselogimisviibal esitatud kindlat kasutajanime. See on eriti oluline „Otsimist pole“ režiimis töötamisel või kui „Nõua rühmaliikmesust“ on lubatud."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Require Group Membership"
msgstr "Nõua rühmaliikmesust"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Require user to be member of group to authenticate. Group settings must be set for this to work, enabling without proper group settings will cause authentication failure."
msgstr "Nõua autentimiseks, et kasutaja oleks rühma liige. Selleks, et see töötaks, peavad rühma seaded olema määratud; lubamine ilma õigete rühma seadeteta põhjustab autentimise ebaõnnestumise."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "LDAP Group Settings"
msgstr "LDAP rühma seaded"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Group Distinguished Name (DN)"
msgstr "Rühma eristusnimi (DN)"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Distinguished Name of the group that user must have membership."
msgstr "Rühma eristusnimi, mille liige kasutaja peab olema."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Group Member Attribute"
msgstr "Rühma liikme atribuut"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "This refers to the specific attribute within the LDAP directory that holds the usernames of group members. It is crucial to ensure that the attribute value aligns with the configuration specified in the \"Distinguished Name\" or that the actual attribute value is searchable using the settings outlined in the \"Distinguished Name\"."
msgstr "See viitab konkreetsele atribuudile LDAP-kataloogis, mis sisaldab rühma liikmete kasutajanimesid. On oluline tagada, et atribuudi väärtus vastaks valikus „Eristusnimi“ määratud konfiguratsioonile või et tegelik atribuudi väärtus oleks otsitav valikus „Eristusnimi“ kirjeldatud seadetega."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Group Member Type"
msgstr "Rühma liikme tüüp"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Defines if users use full Distinguished Name or just Username in the defined Group Member Attribute."
msgstr "Määrab, kas kasutajad kasutavad määratud rühma liikme atribuudis täielikku eristusnime või ainult kasutajanime."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Distinguished Name"
msgstr "Eristusnimi"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "LDAP Specific Search Settings"
msgstr "LDAP spetsiifilise otsingu seaded"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Search Base"
msgstr "Otsingu baas"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Search base for searching the LDAP directory, such as <i>'dc=win2kdomain,dc=local'</i> or <i>'ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local'</i>."
msgstr "Otsingubaas LDAP-kataloogist otsimiseks, näiteks <i>'dc=win2kdomain,dc=local'</i> või <i>'ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local'</i>."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Search Filter"
msgstr "Otsingufilter"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Search filter to use to locate the user in the LDAP directory, such as for windows: <i>'(&amp;(objectclass=user)(objectcategory=user)(userPrincipalName=&lt;username&gt;*))'</i> or for OpenLDAP: <i>'(&(objectClass=account)(uid=&lt;username&gt))'</i>.  '&lt;username&gt' is replaced with the username that was supplied at the login prompt. "
msgstr "Otsingufilter kasutaja leidmiseks LDAP-kataloogist, näiteks Windowsi puhul: <i>'(&amp;(objectclass=user)(objectcategory=user)(userPrincipalName=&lt;username&gt;*))'</i> või OpenLDAP-i puhul: <i>'(&(objectClass=account)(uid=&lt;username&gt))'</i>.  '&lt;username&gt' asendatakse sisselogimisviibal esitatud kasutajanimega. "

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Search Distinguished Name (DN)"
msgstr "Otsingu eristusnimi (DN)"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Distinguished Name for Specific Searching binding to the LDAP directory."
msgstr "Eristusnimi spetsiifilise otsingu sidumiseks LDAP-kataloogiga."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Search Password"
msgstr "Otsingu parool"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Password for Specific Searching binding to the LDAP directory."
msgstr "Parool spetsiifilise otsingu sidumiseks LDAP-kataloogiga."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "LDAP CN Settings"
msgstr "LDAP CN seaded"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Field that will replace the Full Name when creating a new user, taken from LDAP. (on windows: displayname) "
msgstr "Väli, mis asendab täisnime uue kasutaja loomisel, võetud LDAP-ist. (Windowsis: displayname) "

#: include/global_settings.php package_import.php
msgid "Email"
msgstr "E-post"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Field that will replace the Email taken from LDAP. (on windows: mail)"
msgstr "Väli, mis asendab LDAP-ist võetud e-posti. (Windowsis: mail)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "URL Linking"
msgstr "URL-i linkimine"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Server Base URL"
msgstr "Serveri baas-URL"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the server location that will be used for links to the Kadupul site. This should include the subdirectory if Kadupul does not run from root folder."
msgstr "See on serveri asukoht, mida kasutatakse linkide jaoks Kadupuli saidile. See peaks sisaldama alamkataloogi, kui Kadupul ei tööta juurkataloogist."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Emailing Options"
msgstr "E-posti valikud"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Notify Primary Admin of Issues"
msgstr "Teavita peaadministraatorit probleemidest"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "In cases where the Kadupul server is experiencing problems, should the Primary Administrator be notified by Email?  The Primary Administrator's Kadupul user account is specified under the Authentication tab on Kadupul's settings page. It defaults to the 'admin' account."
msgstr "Kas peaadministraatorit tuleks e-kirjaga teavitada juhtudel, kui Kadupuli serveril on probleeme?  Peaadministraatori Kadupuli kasutajakonto määratakse Kadupuli seadete lehe vahekaardil Autentimine. Vaikimisi on selleks konto 'admin'."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Test Email"
msgstr "Testkiri"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is an Email account used for sending a test message to ensure everything is working properly."
msgstr "See on e-posti konto, mida kasutatakse testsõnumi saatmiseks, et veenduda kõige korrektses toimimises."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Mail Services"
msgstr "Postiteenused"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Which mail service to use in order to send mail"
msgstr "Millist postiteenust kasutada kirjade saatmiseks"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Ping Mail Server"
msgstr "Pingi postiserverit"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Ping the Mail Server before sending test Email?"
msgstr "Kas pingida postiserverit enne testkirja saatmist?"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html_reports.php
msgid "From Email Address"
msgstr "Saatja e-posti aadress"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the Email address that the Email will appear from."
msgstr "See on e-posti aadress, millelt e-kiri paistab olevat saadetud."

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html_reports.php
msgid "From Name"
msgstr "Saatja nimi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the actual name that the Email will appear from."
msgstr "See on tegelik nimi, millelt e-kiri paistab olevat saadetud."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Word Wrap"
msgstr "Reamurdmine"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is how many characters will be allowed before a line in the Email is automatically word wrapped. (0 = Disabled)"
msgstr "Mitu märki lubatakse, enne kui e-kirja rida automaatselt murtakse. (0 = keelatud)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Sendmail Options"
msgstr "Sendmaili valikud"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/functions.php
msgid "Sendmail Path"
msgstr "Sendmaili tee"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the path to sendmail on your server. (Only used if Sendmail is selected as the Mail Service)"
msgstr "See on sendmaili tee sinu serveris. (Kasutatakse ainult siis, kui postiteenuseks on valitud Sendmail)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SMTP Options"
msgstr "SMTP valikud"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SMTP Hostname"
msgstr "SMTP hostinimi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the hostname/IP of the SMTP Server you will send the Email to. For failover, separate your hosts using a semi-colon."
msgstr "See on SMTP-serveri hostinimi/IP, kuhu e-kiri saadetakse. Tõrkesiirde jaoks eralda hostid semikooloniga."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SMTP Port"
msgstr "SMTP port"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The port on the SMTP Server to use."
msgstr "Kasutatav port SMTP-serveris."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SMTP Username"
msgstr "SMTP kasutajanimi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The username to authenticate with when sending via SMTP. (Leave blank if you do not require authentication.)"
msgstr "Kasutajanimi autentimiseks SMTP kaudu saatmisel. (Jäta tühjaks, kui autentimist ei nõuta.)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SMTP Password"
msgstr "SMTP parool"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The password to authenticate with when sending via SMTP. (Leave blank if you do not require authentication.)"
msgstr "Parool autentimiseks SMTP kaudu saatmisel. (Jäta tühjaks, kui autentimist ei nõuta.)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SMTP Security"
msgstr "SMTP turvalisus"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The encryption method to use for the Email."
msgstr "E-posti jaoks kasutatav krüptimismeetod."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SSL"
msgstr "SSL"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TLS"
msgstr "TLS"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SMTP Timeout"
msgstr "SMTP ajalõpp"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Please enter the SMTP timeout in seconds."
msgstr "Sisesta SMTP ajalõpp sekundites."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Reporting Presets"
msgstr "Aruandluse eelseadistused"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default Graph Image Format"
msgstr "Vaikimisi graafiku pildivorming"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When creating a new report, what image type should be used for the inline graphs?"
msgstr "Millist pilditüüpi tuleks uue aruande loomisel kasutada tekstisiseste graafikute jaoks?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Email Size"
msgstr "Maksimaalne e-kirja suurus"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum size of the Email message including all attachments."
msgstr "E-kirja maksimaalne suurus koos kõigi manustega."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Logging Level for Kadupul Reporting"
msgstr "Pollija logitase Kadupuli aruandluse jaoks"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "What level of detail do you want sent to the log file? WARNING: Leaving in any other status than NONE or LOW can exhaust your disk space rapidly."
msgstr "Kui üksikasjalikke andmeid soovid logifaili saata? HOIATUS: mis tahes muu olek kui NONE või LOW võib kiiresti ketta täis kirjutada."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Lotus Notes (R) tweak"
msgstr "Luba Lotus Notes (R) kohandus"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable code tweak for specific handling of Lotus Notes Mail Clients."
msgstr "Luba koodikohandus Lotus Notes'i meilikliente spetsiaalselt käsitlemiseks."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "DNS Options"
msgstr "DNS-i valikud"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Primary DNS IP Address"
msgstr "Primaarne DNS-i IP-aadress"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enter the primary DNS IP Address to utilize for reverse lookups."
msgstr "Sisesta pöördotsinguteks kasutatav primaarne DNS-i IP-aadress."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Secondary DNS IP Address"
msgstr "Sekundaarne DNS-i IP-aadress"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enter the secondary DNS IP Address to utilize for reverse lookups."
msgstr "Sisesta pöördotsinguteks kasutatav sekundaarne DNS-i IP-aadress."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "DNS Timeout"
msgstr "DNS-i ajalõpp"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Please enter the DNS timeout in milliseconds.  Kadupul uses a PHP based DNS resolver."
msgstr "Sisesta DNS-i ajalõpp millisekundites.  Kadupul kasutab PHP-põhist DNS-i lahendajat."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "On-demand RRD Update Settings"
msgstr "Nõudmisel RRD uuendamise seaded"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable On-demand RRD Updating"
msgstr "Luba nõudmisel RRD uuendamine"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Should Boost enable on demand RRD updating in Kadupul?  If you disable, this change will not take effect until after the next polling cycle.  When you have Remote Data Collectors, this setting is required to be on."
msgstr "Kas Boost peaks Kadupulis lubama nõudmisel RRD uuendamise?  Kui keelad, ei jõustu muudatus enne järgmist pollimistsüklit.  Kui sul on kaugandmekogujaid, peab see seadistus olema sisse lülitatud."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "System Level RRD Updater"
msgstr "Süsteemitaseme RRD uuendaja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Before RRD On-demand Update Can be Cleared, a poller run must always pass"
msgstr "Enne RRD nõudmisel uuenduse tühistamist peab pollija käitus alati läbi minema"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How Often Should Boost Update All RRDs"
msgstr "Kui sageli peaks Boost kõiki RRD-sid uuendama"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When you enable boost, your RRD files are only updated when they are requested by a user, or when this time period elapses."
msgstr "Kui lubad Boosti, uuendatakse sinu RRD-faile ainult siis, kui kasutaja neid nõuab või kui see ajaperiood möödub."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of Boost Processes"
msgstr "Boosti protsesside arv"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent boost processes to use to process all of the RRDs in the boost table."
msgstr "Samaaegsete Boosti protsesside arv, mida kasutada kõigi Boosti tabelis olevate RRD-de töötlemiseks."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Boost Processing Mode"
msgstr "Boosti töötlemisrežiim"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How Boost distributes RRD updates. Forked processes start the number of Boost processes above on every run. Message queue workers hand each partition to Messenger workers instead."
msgstr "Kuidas Boost RRD uuendusi jaotab. Haarutatud protsessid käivitavad ülaltoodud arvu Boosti protsesse igal käitusel. Sõnumijärjekorra töötajad annavad iga partitsiooni selle asemel Messengeri töötajatele."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Forked processes"
msgstr "Haarutatud protsessid"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Message queue workers"
msgstr "Sõnumijärjekorra töötajad"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Records"
msgstr "Maksimaalne kirjete arv"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If the boost output table exceeds this size, in records, an update will take place."
msgstr "Kui Boosti väljundtabel ületab selle suuruse kirjetes, toimub uuendus."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Data Source Items Per Pass"
msgstr "Maksimaalne andmeallika kirjete arv ühe läbimise kohta"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "To optimize performance, the boost RRD updater needs to know how many Data Source Items should be retrieved in one pass.  Please be careful not to set too high as graphing performance during major updates can be compromised.  If you encounter graphing or polling slowness during updates, lower this number.  The default value is 50000."
msgstr "Jõudluse optimeerimiseks peab Boosti RRD uuendaja teadma, mitu andmeallika kirjet tuleks ühe läbimisega tuua.  Ole ettevaatlik, et seda mitte liiga kõrgeks seada, kuna graafikute jõudlus suurte uuenduste ajal võib kannatada.  Kui uuenduste ajal tekib graafikute kuvamise või pollimise aeglus, vähenda seda arvu.  Vaikeväärtus on 50000."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Argument Length"
msgstr "Maksimaalne argumendi pikkus"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When boost sends update commands to RRDtool, it must not exceed the operating system's Maximum Argument Length.  This varies by operating system and kernel level.  For example: Windows 2000 <= 2048, FreeBSD <= 65535, Linux 2.6.22-- <= 131072, Linux 2.6.23++ unlimited"
msgstr "Kui Boost saadab RRDtool-ile uuendamiskäske, ei tohi see ületada operatsioonisüsteemi maksimaalset argumendi pikkust.  See varieerub operatsioonisüsteemi ja kerneli taseme järgi.  Näiteks: Windows 2000 <= 2048, FreeBSD <= 65535, Linux 2.6.22-- <= 131072, Linux 2.6.23++ piiramatu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Memory Limit for Boost and Poller"
msgstr "Boosti ja pollija mälupiirang"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of memory for the Kadupul Poller and Boosts Poller"
msgstr "Kadupuli pollija ja Boosti pollija maksimaalne mälumaht"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum RRD Update Script Run Time"
msgstr "Maksimaalne RRD uuendusskripti tööaeg"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If the boost poller exceeds this runtime, a warning will be placed in the cacti log."
msgstr "Kui Boosti pollija ületab selle tööaja, lisatakse cacti logisse hoiatus."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable direct population of poller_output_boost table"
msgstr "Luba poller_output_boost tabeli otsene täitmine"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enables direct insert of records into poller output boost which results in a 25% time reduction in each poll cycle."
msgstr "Lubab kirjete otsese lisamise poller output boost tabelisse, mis vähendab iga pollimistsükli aega 25%."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Boost Debug Log"
msgstr "Boosti silumislogi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If this field is non-blank, Boost will log RRDUpdate output from the boost poller process."
msgstr "Kui see väli ei ole tühi, logib Boost Boosti pollija protsessi RRDUpdate väljundi."

#: include/global_settings.php utilities.php
msgid "Image Caching"
msgstr "Piltide vahemällu salvestamine"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Image Caching"
msgstr "Luba piltide vahemällu salvestamine"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Should image caching be enabled?"
msgstr "Kas piltide vahemällu salvestamine peaks olema lubatud?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Location for Image Files"
msgstr "Piltide failide asukoht"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Specify the location where Boost should place your image files.  These files will be automatically purged by the poller when they expire."
msgstr "Määra asukoht, kuhu Boost peaks sinu pildifailid paigutama.  Pollija kustutab need failid aegumisel automaatselt."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Sources Statistics"
msgstr "Andmeallikate statistika"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Data Source Statistics Collection"
msgstr "Luba andmeallika statistika kogumine"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Should Data Source Statistics be collected for this Kadupul system?"
msgstr "Kas selle Kadupuli süsteemi jaoks tuleks koguda andmeallika statistikat?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of DSStats Processes"
msgstr "DSStats-protsesside arv"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent DSStats processes to use to process all of the Data Sources."
msgstr "Samaaegsete DSStats-protsesside arv, mida kasutada kõigi andmeallikate töötlemiseks."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Daily Update Frequency"
msgstr "Päevase uuendamise sagedus"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How frequently should Daily Stats be updated?"
msgstr "Kui sageli tuleks päevast statistikat uuendada?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Hourly Average Window"
msgstr "Tunnikeskmise aken"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of consecutive hours that represent the hourly average.  Keep in mind that a setting too high can result in very large memory tables"
msgstr "Järjestikuste tundide arv, mis moodustavad tunnikeskmise.  Pea meeles, et liiga kõrge seadistus võib põhjustada väga suuri mälutabeleid"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maintenance Time"
msgstr "Hooldusaeg"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "What time of day should Weekly, Monthly, and Yearly Data be updated?  Format is HH:MM [am/pm]"
msgstr "Mis kellaajal tuleks uuendada nädala-, kuu- ja aastaandmeid?  Vorming on HH:MM [am/pm]"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Memory Limit for Data Source Statistics Data Collector"
msgstr "Andmeallika statistika andmekoguja mälupiirang"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of memory for the Kadupul Poller and Data Source Statistics Poller"
msgstr "Kadupuli pollija ja andmeallika statistika pollija maksimaalne mälumaht"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Native Alerting"
msgstr "Natiivne teavitamine"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Native Alert Evaluation"
msgstr "Luba natiivne teavituste hindamine"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Should the main Data Collector evaluate alert rules after each polling cycle and send their notifications? Alert rules read the rates that Data Source Statistics collects, so Data Source Statistics Collection must also be enabled."
msgstr "Kas peamine andmekoguja peaks pärast iga pollimistsüklit hindama teavitusreegleid ja saatma nende teavitusi? Teavitusreeglid loevad määrasid, mida andmeallika statistika kogub, seega peab ka andmeallika statistika kogumine olema lubatud."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Alert Rules per Batch"
msgstr "Teavitusreegleid partii kohta"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of alert rules read and evaluated together. The time budget is checked between batches."
msgstr "Koos loetavate ja hinnatavate teavitusreeglite arv. Ajaeelarvet kontrollitakse partiide vahel."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Rules"
msgstr "%d reeglit"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Alert Evaluation Time Budget"
msgstr "Teavituste hindamise ajaeelarve"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How long one evaluation run may start new batches of rules. Sending queued notifications follows evaluation with the time left, and may send one batch even when the budget is spent. Rules not reached are evaluated first by the next run."
msgstr "Kui kaua üks hindamiskäitus võib käivitada uusi reeglipartiisid. Järjekorras olevate teavituste saatmine järgneb hindamisele allesjäänud ajaga ja võib saata ühe partii ka siis, kui eelarve on otsas. Reeglid, milleni ei jõutud, hinnatakse järgmisel käitusel esimesena."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "RRDfile Check"
msgstr "RRDfile'i kontroll"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable RRDfile Check"
msgstr "Luba RRDfile'i kontroll"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Should RRDfile check be enabled for this Kadupul system?"
msgstr "Kas selle Kadupuli süsteemi jaoks tuleks RRDfile'i kontroll lubada?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of RRDfile Check Processes"
msgstr "RRDfile'i kontrolli protsesside arv"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent RRDfile check processes to use to process all of rrd files."
msgstr "Samaaegsete RRDfile'i kontrolli protsesside arv, mida kasutada kõigi rrd-failide töötlemiseks."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Check Frequency"
msgstr "Kontrolli sagedus"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How frequently should RRD be checked?"
msgstr "Kui sageli tuleks RRD-sid kontrollida?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Storage Settings"
msgstr "Andmesalvestuse seaded"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Choose if RRDs will be stored locally or being handled by an external RRDtool proxy server."
msgstr "Vali, kas RRD-sid salvestatakse lokaalselt või käsitleb neid väline RRDtool-i proksiserver."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "RRDtool Proxy Server"
msgstr "RRDtool-i proksiserver"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Structure RRDfile Paths"
msgstr "Struktureeri RRDfile'i teed"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Structured Paths"
msgstr "Luba struktureeritud teed"

#: include/global_settings.php
