#: utilities.php
msgid "The Kadupul Log stores statistics, error and other messages depending on system settings.  This information can be used to identify problems with the poller and application."
msgstr "Kadupuli logi salvestab statistikat, vigu ja muid teateid olenevalt süsteemi seadetest.  Seda teavet saab kasutada pollija ja rakendusega seotud probleemide tuvastamiseks."

#: utilities.php
